0.45..1.0 | Ton par plaque grossiere |\n| zone_noise 0.25, zone_cut 0.33/0.04 | Zones calmes |\n| mottle 0.04 (3.0x0.5) x 0.70..1.0 | Modelage doux des faces |\n| plates_height 0..0.32, curl (mask 0.86/0.12, height 0..0.19) | Lift + boucles blanches gagees |\n| rims (shift tx 0.008 ty 0.012, height 0..0.33) | Reflets haut+gauche |\n| shadow (shift ty -0.010, height 0..-0.16) | Ombres de recouvrement |\n| fiber 0.08 (5.0x0.01) +-0.08, micro 0.015 +-0.04 | Grain capillaire + tactilite |\n| hole (mask=cut-holed, micro masque) | Grain dans les trous, final `hole_add` |\n\nGares (presentes, decablees) : edge_ring/ridge (cycle 42), chaine stries\n(streak_grid..streak_add + streak_zone, f1 force, cycle 51), reseau PeelNoise,\n~40 `zrexport_temp` supprimables.\n\n## 6. Les trois snippets VEX finaux (anglais, verifie sans erreur)\n\nbrick_grid (grossier + idmap : MEME lignes row/cols/col, id = row*16+col) :\n\n```c\nfloat u=(float(@ix)+0.5)/float(@resx);\nfloat v=(float(@iy)+0.5)/float(@resy);\nfloat r0=floor(v*12.0);\nfloat v2=v*12.0+(rand(r0*7.3+2.1)-0.5)*0.25;\nfloat row=floor(v2);\nfloat cols=6.0+floor(rand(row*9.17+3.3)*3.0);\nfloat uu=u*cols+rand(row*3.7+1.3);\nfloat fu=frac(uu); float fv=frac(v2);\nfloat gx=smooth(0.0,0.02,fu)*(1.0-smooth(0.98,1.0,fu));\nfloat gy=smooth(0.0,0.02,fv)*(1.0-smooth(0.98,1.0,fv));\n@C=gx*gy;\n```\n\nbrick_idmap : MEME debut, puis\n`float col=floor(u*cols+rand(row*3.7+1.3));`\n`col=col-floor(col/cols)*cols; float id=row*16.0+col; @C=rand(id*1.71+0.37);`\n\nbrick_grid2 (flakes fines, pointes pincees) :\n\n```c\nfloat u=(float(@ix)+0.5)/float(@resx);\nfloat v=(float(@iy)+0.5)/float(@resy);\nfloat r0=floor(v*36.0);\nfloat vv=v*36.0+(rand(r0*3.1+7.7)-0.5)*0.7;\nfloat row=floor(vv);\nfloat cols=4.0+floor(rand(row*7.71+1.9)*4.0);\nfloat uu=u*cols+rand(row*5.1+0.7)+sin(vv*40.0+row*7.0)*0.04+sin(vv*13.0+row*3.0)*0.05;\nfloat fu=frac(uu); float fv=frac(vv);\nfloat taper=smooth(0.0,0.18,fu)*(1.0-smooth(0.82,1.0,fu));\nfloat pinch=lerp(0.45,1.0,taper)